name: Reviewed guidance enters a finite context experiment and retirement blocks future use
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE SEMGREP_APP_TOKEN SEMGREP_AGENT_TOKEN
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/learning_loop.py seed @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
paste-file: @ART/open.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 F-0001 · FINDING | baseline-observation
submit: decision confirmed Confirmed the owned literal policy marker only; no vulnerability is asserted
require-live-snap: 25 recorded: confirmed | human-policy-decision
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/learning_loop.py confirmed @TMP_TARGET @ART
submit: lessons
require-live-snap: 25 REUSABLE LESSONS | empty-lessons
keys: n
require-live-snap: 20 LESSON DRAFT | lesson-title
paste-file: @ART/title.txt
keys: Tab
paste-file: @ART/text.txt
require-live-snap: 20 Unicode café | lesson-text
resize: 160x48
live-snap: lesson-editor-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: lesson-editor-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: lesson-editor-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: lesson-editor-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: lesson-editor-40x12
ask: Can the operator read and edit the lesson at all six sizes while keeping the literal policy observation distinct from a vulnerability claim?
resize: 120x36
keys: Tab
paste-file: @ART/applies.txt
keys: Tab
paste-file: @ART/limits.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CONFIRM LESSON DRAFT | draft-confirmation
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Draft · Owned greeting | saved-draft
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/learning_loop.py draft @TMP_TARGET @ART
keys: a
paste-file: @ART/reason.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CONFIRM ACCEPTED LESSON | acceptance
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Accepted · Owned greeting | accepted-lesson
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/learning_loop.py accepted @TMP_TARGET @ART
keys: Space u
require-live-snap: 25 LESSONS INTO CONTEXT | explicit-base
expect: Selected lessons: 1.
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Enter creates copy | copy-confirmation
ask: Does context reuse name the exact reviewed lesson and base, require a separate copy confirmation and keep the active context unchanged?
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Saved context: | inactive-copy
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/learning_loop.py copy @TMP_TARGET @ART
submit: use sast
submit: options sast:scan
submit: set taskMode manual
submit: set tasks semgrep,agentic
paste-file: @ART/rule-setting.txt
keys: Enter
submit: set semgrepTimeoutMs 60000
paste-file: @ART/candidate-open.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | candidate-study
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 20 ▸ Context comparison | explicit-comparison-row
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Baseline allowance read. | retained-accounting
keys: Up Up Up Up Up Up
require-live-snap: 20 ▸ Source and context | explicit-context-row
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CHOOSE STUDY CONTEXT | choose-copy
keys: Down Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | inspect-copy
keys: p
require-live-snap: 25 THREAT-MODEL TEXT INCLUDED | scanner-context
keys: NPage
require-live-snap: 20 Owned greeting review lesson | supplied-lesson
ask: Is the exact accepted lesson visible in the supplied scanner context, with historical limits and no automatic global-context replacement?
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 Context selected for this study | selected-copy
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 Draft ready | finite-candidate
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/learning_loop.py candidate-draft @TMP_TARGET @ART
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW PLAN & ALLOWANCE | candidate-approval
expect: Total provider calls: 6
expect: Protected review calls: 0
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 y approve | approval-tail
expect: 3 fixed jobs
ask: Does the experiment retain its baseline and six-request intercepted allowance, approving exactly three candidate jobs with no live request or expanded source, engines or limit?
keys: y
require-live-snap: 25 Approval saved | candidate-approved
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 Plan approved | candidate-jobs
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 dispatcher pid | candidate-running
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/learning_loop.py candidate-complete @TMP_TARGET @ART
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 3 completed | completed-experiment
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 1 finding · 1 pending · TP: 0 | experiment-report
expect: 3 completed / 3 planned
expect: no complete coverage claim
expect: source review needed: 1
expect: Earlier decisions remain recorded.
resize: 160x48
live-snap: source-review-report-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: source-review-report-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: source-review-report-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: source-review-report-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: source-review-report-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: source-review-explanation-40x12
ask: Does Report make the retained decision and required source review clear at every size, without counting an unverified source as reviewed or fixed?
resize: 120x36
keys: Home
keys: j j j
require-live-snap: 20 format json (4/6) | json-format
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | exported
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/learning_loop.py exported @TMP_TARGET @ART
submit: lessons
require-live-snap: 25 Accepted · Owned greeting | retained-lesson
keys: t
paste-file: @ART/retire.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CONFIRM RETIRED LESSON | retire-confirmation
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Retired · Owned greeting | retired-lesson
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/learning_loop.py retired @TMP_TARGET @ART
paste-file: @ART/candidate-open.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | future-study
keys: Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CHOOSE STUDY CONTEXT | retired-context-choice
keys: Down Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Lesson context needs review | retired-context-read
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 changed or retired lesson | future-use-blocked
ask: Does retirement preserve the six observations and original human decision while making the copied context ineligible for new work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: lessons
require-live-snap: 25 Retired · Owned greeting | restarted-lesson
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 3 completed | restarted-experiment
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 source review needed: 1 | restarted-source-review-report
expect: Earlier decisions remain recorded.
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/learning_loop.py restarted @TMP_TARGET @ART
ask: Does no-color restart retain the retired guidance, completed experiment and six settled intercepted requests without another job or live provider request?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
